' ============================================================
' TÍTULO
' ============================================================

title
<b><size:16><color:#1E293B>DEVOPS-05 — Observabilidad</color></size></b>
<size:11><color:#64748B>Métricas, logs, trazas y reglas de alerta</color></size>
end title

' ============================================================
' COMPONENTES — FUENTE DE VERDAD
' ============================================================

rectangle "<b>Spring Boot Services</b>\n<size:10><color:#1E40AF>Actuator + Micrometer + OTel</color></size>" as S <<source>>

rectangle "<b>Prometheus</b>\n<size:10><color:#155E75><&dashboard> Métricas</color></size>" as Prometheus <<metrics>>

rectangle "<b>Grafana</b>\n<size:10><color:#5B21B6><&monitor> Visualización</color></size>" as Grafana <<visualization>>

rectangle "<b>Loki</b>\n<size:10><color:#92400E><&file> Logs</color></size>" as Loki <<logs>>

rectangle "<b>Alloy/Promtail</b>\n<size:10><color:#92400E><&filter> Recolección</color></size>" as AG <<logs>>

rectangle "<b>Jaeger</b>\n<size:10><color:#3730A3><&search> Tracing</color></size>" as Jaeger <<tracing>>

rectangle "<b>Alert rules</b>\n<size:10><color:#991B1B><&warning> Reglas de alerta</color></size>" as ALERT <<alert>>

' ============================================================
' RELACIONES — FUENTE DE VERDAD
' ============================================================

S --> Prometheus : /actuator/prometheus

Prometheus --> Grafana

S --> AG : JSON logs

AG --> Loki

Loki --> Grafana

S --> Jaeger : traces DEV/QA

Jaeger --> Grafana : consulta/enlace

Prometheus --> ALERT

Loki --> ALERT

' ============================================================
' NOTA — FUENTE DE VERDAD
' ============================================================

note bottom
  <b>Campos mínimos de logs:</b>
  timestamp, level, service, correlationId, traceId, message.

  Nunca credenciales, OTP, JWT completo, refresh token ni secretos.
end note

